Model weights are not distributed in this repository. 'TypeLogic setup' downloads them from their publishers, each
pinned by revision and SHA-256 in config/models.lock.json:

- Plumb-4B v5 GGUF (crh225/plumb-4b-GGUF), Apache License 2.0.
- Clef-Flash GGUF (bartowski/Cloudflare_clef-flash-GGUF, quantization of Cloudflare's clef-flash), Apache License 2.0;
  optional.
- The TypeLogic specialist GGUF: Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B (Alibaba Qwen, Apache License 2.0) with the TypeLogic LoRA adapter
  and decision head (Apache License 2.0), converted with llama.cpp; published as an asset of the TypeLogic release.
  Its decision head follows the pointer model of kev (Jared Palmer, Apache License 2.0), which llama.cpp serves as
  the 'kev' family; no kev code is included here.

